#: lib/phoenix_kit_warehouse/web/components/line_explanations.ex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The order is the requirement of the internal order minus the stock on hand at the warehouse location at the moment of generation. On import, the quantity already ordered in other supplier orders is subtracted as well. The supplier is the one found for the item: the primary supplier or one through the manufacturer. Items without a single supplier do not get into this order. If the quantity in the order was edited by hand, it may differ from the calculation."
msgstr "The order is the requirement of the internal order minus the stock on hand at the warehouse location at the moment of generation. On import, the quantity already ordered in other supplier orders is subtracted as well. The supplier is the one found for the item: the primary supplier or one through the manufacturer. Items without a single supplier do not get into this order. If the quantity in the order was edited by hand, it may differ from the calculation."
